abstract: >-
  Monthly, versioned, facility-level releases of U.S. nursing home data built
  from Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services public files: Care Compare
  provider information, penalties and ownership, PECOS enrollments, owners and
  changes of ownership, and chain performance measures. Every column is tagged
  with its provenance; derived columns are documented in the codebook and
  methodology.
